### Track 7: Concurrency, Actors & Fault-Tolerant Supervision
  [ ] RTB-24: Location-transparent actor mailboxes & micro-fibers (lockless green-fiber scheduler).
  [ ] RTB-25: Erlang-style OTP supervision trees (hierarchical actor restart, backoff & state recovery).
  [ ] RTB-26: Token-sealed capability RPC (cryptographically authenticated actor wire protocol under &NetCap).

### Track 8: Zero-Trust Security & OS-Kernel Attenuation
  [ ] RTB-27: Hierarchical capability attenuation (scoped sub-capability derivation without ambient leak).
  [ ] RTB-28: Cryptographic object capabilities (C-Caps with HMAC-SHA256 tamper-proof seals).
  [ ] RTB-29: Hardware enclave & confidential compute integration (AMD SEV / Intel SGX for SECRET fields).

### Track 9: Native Code Generation, Binary Tooling & Optimizations
  [ ] RTB-30: Standalone native x86_64 / AArch64 machine-code backend (sub-millisecond compilation).
  [ ] RTB-31: Cross-language link-time optimization (LTO) & direct C-header FFI under &SysCap).
  [ ] RTB-32: Bit-identical reproducible build normalizer (zero-timestamp deterministic binary output).

